<description>&lt;p&gt;Recent drone strikes on Colombian military bases in the north have killed three to five soldiers and wounded dozens, showing intensified attacks by armed groups against the army. Armed men entered a house in Toro and murdered three women, adding to civilian casualties. The ELN and FARC dissident factions are fighting over power, leaving civilians under siege. The conflict remains a low-intensity asymmetric war involving the government, paramilitary groups, crime syndicates and far-left guerrillas. The UCDP recorded 225 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxNRUxoTG83UlZ0blB4bjQzb1pGZzh3azlqN01nd0RXaVF3eFlXZ253U3V3RS1JaDMta2VYNkp0THdnYjhzQk1CUVo0b3Vsb1NoRXlncW5jTzBaOHBaOTFiMmVCamJnNWxCTVZwM2Rfcmp6WjZkNWREeHJuejhDY3U4SmJTRi1Kbm5WX0ZHY3BNNVNSbWVCWE5OUzE0bFhmaG1GWE1IOXV2V0l5YTFxamVBd05Saw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxPVkQyTU5QLS1RV0N3SU1iekhjb2pIbmpEOGJOZUZYaFA2di1zVXdQa0RHNjRmODhJYWRPSVFfWlZXNmFvM2F1YVdydHNzaWZQRHVjOUJDTkt2VHhSQXgwNkdYdlZQVXlpWTJCNVRyZG1hLWdEdG9zdllaLS0zX0Z1UHhnaTF4TzY2Tkt3N1NlNkZvTjQyYk9zZl9OY1VWVmc1bFY4?oc=5&quot;&gt;Mail &amp;amp; Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxPUjV5bGtadmkyb0E0WTRTQ2RrQVZ0a3hwRXRndEdlMTRmRkRNVFlxSmdFeVZWeWgxQXMxMFZDR0xsWjd4bm1vRW95QVpUNnRUUDZ0LXZRRExYSXA2MEJBTDQtb2JBNkdybE96aHBLdC1rNzAtZl8tRGxIMml4NFZONm5ONGx3TUFiTDZnZ19iYWhHMVV0ajZKWUF3QmxibHB4R1o4MmlueUZQYXNwamc?oc=5&quot;&gt;İlke Haber Ajansı&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxONHh1anZpWXRhRWlUQUlzY2ttYm03TkRkOF85Vklra292ODgzV2pFLW1SLWVrRHJITEY1eUJZaWlKVkI4dVBKOHZZY1FCZk5aWkZQanVqLTc4dFFoN